  <dist>/klib/platform/macos_arm64/ ships 200+ org.jetbrains.kotlin.native.platform.*
  klibs (posix, Foundation, AppKit, ...).
Consequence: the artifact's dynamic dependency set is a function of package
source, so decision 0008 section 3's base-installation clause needs a
post-link, pre-publish check; it cannot be discharged by a pre-compile file
walk. The cycle-1 "stdlib only / no C interop" statement was wrong.

